  "methodology": "Other",
  "methodology_other": "Data were collected from Censo Nacional de Población y Vivienda 2018 and the 3er Censo Nacional Agropecuario. Census Bureau staff altered boundaries and modified the statistical data as detailed in the Metadata tab of the tabular data.",
  "name": "colombia-subnational-boundaries-and-tabular-data",
  "notes": "The geodatabase contains boundaries for the national and first-, second-, and third-order administrative divisions, aligned to the Large Scale International Boundaries dataset from the U.S. Department of State. The feature classes are suitable for linking to the attribute data provided.\r\n\r\nThe tabular data contain total population for 2018 (census), as well as five-year age group and sex, and information relating to individuals, indigenous groups, households, housing, poverty, health, and agriculture.\r\n\r\nAn additional table contains subnational population estimates and projections by 5-year age group and sex for the years 2015 to 2030, based on trends between Colombia’s 2005 and 2018 populations censuses. ",
